# Adexa + Yadore daily click postbacks (skip feeds already completed today).
# Copy to crontab if Flask/Gunicorn is not running 24/7.
#
# Default in-app schedule: 12:30 Asia/Jerusalem (ADEXA_YADORE_DAILY_POSTBACK_SCHEDULER_*).
# Yadore sales remain on the separate 10:00 YADORE_SALES_SCHEDULER_* job.
# Run log: data/adexa_yadore_daily_postbacks_run_log.json
#
# 30 12 * * * cd /path/to/KLblend && /usr/bin/python3 cli/run_adexa_yadore_daily_postbacks_scheduled.py >> runtime/logs/adexa_yadore_daily_postbacks.log 2>&1
